      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm working on a policy memo for our senior partners regarding long-term economic stability. Based on current economic trends and data, which approach to wealth redistribution is more likely to ensure actual societal stability in the US over the next few decades: a Universal Basic Income (UBI) or sticking to more traditional, targeted welfare programs?",
